WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.360 --> 00:00:02.480
- Well, I think it's cool
that you produce, write,

00:00:02.480 --> 00:00:04.030
and do these movies yourself.

00:00:04.030 --> 00:00:06.670
- Yes.
- I mean, it's crazy stuff,

00:00:06.670 --> 00:00:09.350
but it's crazy like a fox
'cause you're pretty much

00:00:09.350 --> 00:00:11.260
the whole movie company, aren't you?

00:00:11.260 --> 00:00:13.440
- Well, me and my partners,
Spike Jonze and Jeff Tremaine

00:00:13.440 --> 00:00:14.273
we all do it ourselves.

00:00:14.273 --> 00:00:15.106
- [Jay] Right, but you know what I mean.

00:00:15.106 --> 00:00:16.073
It isn't one of these things-
- Yeah.

00:00:16.073 --> 00:00:16.906
- [Jay] Where Warner Brother gets 2%

00:00:16.906 --> 00:00:19.510
and somebody in the other studio gets 9%,

00:00:19.510 --> 00:00:21.240
you know what I mean, those things?

00:00:21.240 --> 00:00:24.103
So you can pretty much, you
know where all the money goes.

00:00:24.103 --> 00:00:26.150
- Yeah, if you're gonna wreck yourself

00:00:26.150 --> 00:00:27.560
you might as well get paid
for it, you know? (laughs)

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:30.870
- Right, right, exactly,
exactly, exactly, exactly.

00:00:30.870 --> 00:00:33.200
Okay, so what can we expect?

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:34.649
I know we can expect to
see you in the movie.

00:00:34.649 --> 00:00:37.913
(Johnny laughing)
but tell me some more.

00:00:38.970 --> 00:00:40.210
- Oh my goodness.

00:00:40.210 --> 00:00:43.400
Well there's fun with bulls.
There's always a bull.

00:00:43.400 --> 00:00:46.240
It's probably the worst
bull hit I've ever taken.

00:00:46.240 --> 00:00:47.073
- [Jay] Really?

00:00:47.073 --> 00:00:48.050
- Spend the weekend in the hospital.

00:00:48.050 --> 00:00:49.490
- So no bull, this is the worst bull-

00:00:49.490 --> 00:00:51.295
- [Johnny] Yeah, no bull, you know what.

00:00:51.295 --> 00:00:52.128
- Ah yeah, okay.

00:00:52.128 --> 00:00:54.060
- Yeah, everything you see is real.

00:00:54.060 --> 00:00:56.010
That's one thing we have on our side

00:00:56.010 --> 00:00:57.040
in the "Jackass" movies.

00:00:57.040 --> 00:00:59.120
It's all, it's the truth.

00:00:59.120 --> 00:01:01.580
- Well see, that's okay 'cause
in most Hollywood films,

00:01:01.580 --> 00:01:04.880
there'd be a stuntman or a sensible person

00:01:04.880 --> 00:01:07.040
doing some sort of CGI.
- [Johnny] Right.

00:01:07.040 --> 00:01:09.480
- You actually kill the
people, yeah, yeah. (chuckles)

00:01:09.480 --> 00:01:11.620
- Yeah, no, we wreck the guys.

00:01:11.620 --> 00:01:14.180
They don't know what's
coming when they walk on set.

00:01:14.180 --> 00:01:17.560
So by the end of the film,
they're suffering from PTSD.

00:01:17.560 --> 00:01:19.530
They are like, you can
walk up behind someone

00:01:19.530 --> 00:01:20.870
and just put your finger on their shoulder

00:01:20.870 --> 00:01:21.890
and they'll go down.

00:01:21.890 --> 00:01:24.950
- Right, just because-
- Yeah, they're in terror.

00:01:24.950 --> 00:01:27.030
- Now, you come from a family-

00:01:27.030 --> 00:01:29.091
- I'd like to say I feel bad but I don't.

00:01:29.091 --> 00:01:29.924
(audience laughing)

